## What this licence does NOT cover

- **The linked articles.** Every row cites a news report, court order or
  official notice. Those remain the copyright of their publishers. This
  dataset licenses the *index*, not the sources it points at.
- **Any implication of fact.** The data records what was publicly reported.
  It is not a legal finding. An arrest is not a conviction, and several rows
  record allegations that were later officially rejected.
